00:28:54.170 --> 00:28:57.166
- Not bad?
- Pretty good, even.


00:28:57.817 --> 00:28:59.381
It's a lesbian poem?


00:29:05.237 --> 00:29:06.452
You'll kill me!


00:29:10.142 --> 00:29:11.357
How do you wear it?


00:29:11.530 --> 00:29:13.050
I'm used to suffering.


00:29:18.084 --> 00:29:19.560
Are you suffocating?


00:29:20.341 --> 00:29:21.469
Are you?


00:29:24.421 --> 00:29:26.504
What is it like to have one?


00:29:26.981 --> 00:29:28.328
Can you show me?


00:29:29.367 --> 00:29:31.973
Next time I'll bring another woman.


00:29:32.450 --> 00:29:35.097
We'll both make love to her.


00:29:36.658 --> 00:29:38.179
It'll do you good.


00:29:38.830 --> 00:29:40.480
She'll watch you.


00:29:43.082 --> 00:29:44.210
I'm not enough?


00:29:44.341 --> 00:29:45.557
Yes, but...


00:29:48.290 --> 00:29:49.115
But?


00:29:49.288 --> 00:29:50.982
Three is more fun.


00:29:54.191 --> 00:29:57.447
She can be between us, looking at you.


00:30:05.910 --> 00:30:07.430
You're playing with me.


00:30:07.560 --> 00:30:09.515
Not with you.  I just play.


00:30:12.681 --> 00:30:15.155
I hate you.


00:30:16.370 --> 00:30:17.801
Who for example?


00:30:17.932 --> 00:30:19.627
You have other mistresses?


00:30:19.799 --> 00:30:21.665
Would I love you less?


00:30:22.706 --> 00:30:24.270
If I had others?


00:30:25.136 --> 00:30:26.482
Answer me.


00:30:26.743 --> 00:30:28.956
- Do you?
- Would I love you less?


00:30:29.391 --> 00:30:31.474
Of course I have others.


00:30:33.079 --> 00:30:37.072
- I love you.
- Would I love you more if I had others?


00:30:37.245 --> 00:30:38.244
You can't.


00:30:38.375 --> 00:30:39.503
- I can.
- No.


00:30:39.677 --> 00:30:41.500
- I can.
- Don't ever try.


00:30:43.495 --> 00:30:45.752
Only you can do me good.


00:30:51.265 --> 00:30:53.825
Your poem was a lot more fun.


00:30:56.819 --> 00:30:58.512
Did you write it?


00:31:02.461 --> 00:31:04.458
You read Pierre's manuscript?


00:31:04.630 --> 00:31:07.496
A few pages.
I have some reservations.


00:31:07.669 --> 00:31:09.710
Not about the style.


00:31:10.142 --> 00:31:12.573
- What is this about?
- Pierre.


00:31:12.747 --> 00:31:15.395
<i>His book,
The Woman and the Puppet.</i>


00:31:15.654 --> 00:31:17.780
What is the woman like?


00:31:18.257 --> 00:31:19.995
Dark-haired, as usual.


00:31:20.385 --> 00:31:21.991
And very seductive.


00:31:22.468 --> 00:31:24.334
He writes well, undeniably.


00:31:24.507 --> 00:31:26.721
But he may be going too far.


00:31:27.155 --> 00:31:28.719
I don't believe it.


00:31:28.891 --> 00:31:30.627
A girl from the gutter


00:31:30.801 --> 00:31:33.925
manipulates her benefactor
like a puppet.


00:31:35.140 --> 00:31:38.482
A gentleman cannot be so easily
conned.


00:31:38.655 --> 00:31:40.782
Pierre has imagination.


00:31:40.913 --> 00:31:44.168
She sleeps with someone else
and he allows it.


00:31:44.342 --> 00:31:45.644
Is that believable?


00:31:45.816 --> 00:31:47.943
Not so easily, I agree.


00:33:33.362 --> 00:33:34.490
Fly!


00:33:35.880 --> 00:33:37.312
No sense of morality?


00:33:37.485 --> 00:33:38.830
Does it bother you?


00:33:38.960 --> 00:33:40.524
No, it thrills me.


00:33:48.117 --> 00:33:50.461
Not yet.
I want to take your picture.


00:33:57.318 --> 00:33:59.619
You're handsome
when you concentrate.


00:34:00.400 --> 00:34:02.354
Don't fall.


00:34:10.903 --> 00:34:13.116
- I don't move?
- Or talk.


00:34:13.897 --> 00:34:15.025
Quiet.


00:34:18.975 --> 00:34:20.494
<i>Give me remorse.</i>


00:34:21.144 --> 00:34:22.664
<i>Lots of remorse.</i>


00:34:36.249 --> 00:34:39.026
I'd like to remember every second.


00:34:44.320 --> 00:34:46.275
I'm in your collection now?


00:34:46.446 --> 00:34:48.444
Pinned up with the others?


00:34:48.617 --> 00:34:50.049
You searched my papers?


00:34:50.222 --> 00:34:52.133
Yes, wasn't I supposed to?


00:34:55.431 --> 00:34:56.602
Kiss me.


00:35:22.990 --> 00:35:24.857
You can't stay longer?


00:35:29.499 --> 00:35:30.498
I'm late.


00:35:30.671 --> 00:35:33.710
It's as if you already left
anyway.


00:35:40.349 --> 00:35:41.478
Help me.


00:36:00.139 --> 00:36:02.397
- This one?
- I'll take it please.


00:36:03.090 --> 00:36:04.350
10 sous.


00:36:05.696 --> 00:36:07.040
Here you go.


00:36:09.992 --> 00:36:10.990
Flowers?


00:36:11.554 --> 00:36:13.723
- How much?
- 10 sous, sir.


00:36:20.580 --> 00:36:21.883
Undress.


00:36:32.951 --> 00:36:34.079
Raise your arms.


00:36:34.730 --> 00:36:36.294
Yes, like that.


00:36:42.888 --> 00:36:43.930
Excellent.


00:36:51.307 --> 00:36:52.436
Turn around.


00:36:54.909 --> 00:36:56.169
More slowly.


00:37:29.066 --> 00:37:30.715
It needs to be dark.


00:37:38.874 --> 00:37:40.306
Let me see.


00:37:42.042 --> 00:37:43.301
Show me.


00:37:44.733 --> 00:37:45.905
Come on.


00:37:46.513 --> 00:37:47.684
Wait...


00:37:55.626 --> 00:37:56.886
Come in.


00:38:04.394 --> 00:38:05.479
Look.


00:38:12.378 --> 00:38:13.680
Can I have it?


00:38:16.589 --> 00:38:18.324
For our secret album?


00:38:41.196 --> 00:38:42.890
Who's with Pierre?


00:38:53.174 --> 00:38:54.346
How graceful.


00:39:01.941 --> 00:39:03.462
Marriage suits you.


00:39:03.591 --> 00:39:05.022
You're gorgeous.


00:39:05.934 --> 00:39:09.623
If it has hidden virtues,
I don't know them.


00:39:17.261 --> 00:39:19.431
How nice to see you clothed.


00:39:41.261 --> 00:39:42.867
I don't feel well.


00:39:43.301 --> 00:39:44.778
Let's go home.


00:39:45.862 --> 00:39:47.424
Please, I never get out!


00:39:47.555 --> 00:39:49.205
People are staring.


00:39:50.939 --> 00:39:53.153
- I can't.
- Marie, stop.


00:39:57.711 --> 00:39:59.404
We'll go discreetly later.


00:40:13.552 --> 00:40:14.897
93...


00:40:16.285 --> 00:40:18.065
94...


00:40:33.560 --> 00:40:34.861
100.


00:40:48.749 --> 00:40:49.964
Goodnight, Marie.


00:41:12.878 --> 00:41:15.397
<i>Pierrot, my favourite horseman</i>


00:41:18.477 --> 00:41:20.560
<i>Henri gets back at 5.
We're alone.</i>


00:41:20.734 --> 00:41:22.165
<i>You're mad.</i>


00:41:38.572 --> 00:41:40.221
Don't make fun of him.


00:42:52.958 --> 00:42:54.653
Pierre doesn't love you!


00:42:55.043 --> 00:42:57.647
He shares Zohra
with his friends at night.


00:42:58.600 --> 00:43:00.770
You saw how infatuated he is!


00:43:02.333 --> 00:43:03.331
Stop.


00:43:04.242 --> 00:43:05.589
Stop, you're...


00:43:07.281 --> 00:43:09.885
You're hurting me...


00:43:11.185 --> 00:43:12.749
You're hurting me!


00:43:12.879 --> 00:43:14.398
What do you want?


00:43:14.571 --> 00:43:17.915
To be treated like Zohra?
Like a whore?


00:43:21.081 --> 00:43:22.123
My love...


00:43:25.682 --> 00:43:26.506
Stop.


00:43:27.244 --> 00:43:30.066
What did I do to you?


00:43:45.646 --> 00:43:47.122
I don't love you.


00:43:47.468 --> 00:43:49.074
I don't love you.


00:43:55.629 --> 00:43:57.626
I don't love you!


00:45:59.100 --> 00:46:02.224
<i>Her whole body was expressive,
like a face.</i>


00:46:02.874 --> 00:46:04.264
<i>More than a face.</i>


00:46:04.524 --> 00:46:07.649
<i>Her head full of hair
fell on her shoulder</i>


00:46:07.823 --> 00:46:09.343
<i>like something useless.</i>


00:46:10.166 --> 00:46:12.770
<i>Smiles in the fold of her hips,</i>


00:46:13.031 --> 00:46:15.853
<i>blushing cheeks
at the bend of her side,</i>


00:46:16.330 --> 00:46:19.888
<i>her chest looked ahead
with two eyes, fixed</i>


00:46:20.018 --> 00:46:21.234
<i>and black.</i>


00:46:43.844 --> 00:46:45.538
Why are you frowning?


00:46:46.710 --> 00:46:47.926
Are you crying?


00:46:51.354 --> 00:46:52.482
What is it?


00:46:53.350 --> 00:46:54.608
What?


00:46:57.820 --> 00:46:58.862
Is it me?


00:47:15.527 --> 00:47:17.698
I don't want you to be sad.


00:47:17.869 --> 00:47:19.389
Not because of me.


00:47:24.727 --> 00:47:25.812
Don't move.


00:47:42.044 --> 00:47:43.085
Stop.


00:47:55.195 --> 00:47:57.670
Cold Paris light doesn't suit you.


00:47:59.969 --> 00:48:01.184
I'll only know you


00:48:01.313 --> 00:48:03.961
when I take you somewhere
with date trees


00:48:04.135 --> 00:48:05.828
and oleander.


00:48:12.945 --> 00:48:15.810
You're wasting away here.
You need light.


00:48:15.983 --> 00:48:17.807
I won't go back alone.


00:48:17.979 --> 00:48:19.325
You won't be alone.


00:48:20.887 --> 00:48:24.706
You're a model, seductive.
Someone will tend to you.


00:48:28.786 --> 00:48:32.258
You must leave.
I can't explain, but you must.


00:48:33.950 --> 00:48:35.251
When will you come?


00:48:38.334 --> 00:48:40.592
You love me and chase me away.


00:48:45.451 --> 00:48:47.014
You need me.


00:49:00.728 --> 00:49:02.378
Stop, that's enough!


00:49:02.551 --> 00:49:04.549
I don't want to get upset.


00:49:05.415 --> 00:49:07.890
We had a great time together.


00:49:20.692 --> 00:49:21.864
You'll need it.


00:49:22.038 --> 00:49:24.902
Honey, you have to go now.
Come.


00:50:13.162 --> 00:50:14.377
Why must you send me back?


00:50:14.854 --> 00:50:16.155
I didn't know!


00:50:17.849 --> 00:50:19.414
This is your fault.


00:50:19.586 --> 00:50:21.496
He didn't decide it alone.


00:50:26.572 --> 00:50:27.787
He'll come back to me.


00:50:27.917 --> 00:50:29.177
He loves me!


00:50:32.042 --> 00:50:33.908
He needs me.  I do it all.


00:50:35.035 --> 00:50:36.771
So?  That's not love.


00:50:36.945 --> 00:50:38.377
What would you know?


00:50:38.726 --> 00:50:40.809
I know how to love men.


00:50:40.980 --> 00:50:42.326
Love can't be learned.


00:50:42.761 --> 00:50:43.802
You see?


00:50:45.451 --> 00:50:46.319
You know nothing.


00:51:18.521 --> 00:51:19.521
Have a seat.


00:51:34.449 --> 00:51:37.011
He likes when we do this.


00:51:39.484 --> 00:51:40.525
Head to toe.


00:51:43.390 --> 00:51:44.606
Can you do it?


00:52:45.191 --> 00:52:46.233
Look.


00:53:00.512 --> 00:53:01.944
It's your treasure.


00:53:13.141 --> 00:53:15.138
It needs only your fingers.


00:54:20.019 --> 00:54:21.061
<i>Pierre...</i>


00:54:22.451 --> 00:54:24.492
<i>Remember when you told me</i>


00:54:27.614 --> 00:54:30.176
<i>with you,
my future was guaranteed.</i>


00:54:32.736 --> 00:54:34.038
<i>In the tomb</i>


00:54:37.335 --> 00:54:38.899
<i>you'll write to me.</i>


00:54:41.503 --> 00:54:43.933
<i>To prove we still have something.</i>


00:54:46.625 --> 00:54:48.838
<i>Pierre, how I adore you.</i>


00:54:59.470 --> 00:55:01.120
I read your book.


00:55:04.808 --> 00:55:06.415
And?


00:55:09.148 --> 00:55:10.885
Scandal will make you rich.


00:55:12.708 --> 00:55:14.314
An excellent story.


00:55:14.877 --> 00:55:16.136
It rings true.


00:55:18.610 --> 00:55:21.476
I feel your cuckold lacks
something.


00:55:22.473 --> 00:55:24.167
Noblesse, perhaps.


00:55:25.249 --> 00:55:27.506
More power in the description.


00:55:30.674 --> 00:55:31.588
You think so?


00:55:36.188 --> 00:55:37.967
Are you feeling well?


00:55:41.048 --> 00:55:42.479
Are you in love?


00:55:44.476 --> 00:55:45.736
I'm worried.


00:55:47.167 --> 00:55:49.467
- Teasing me?
- No, I'm worried.


00:55:52.331 --> 00:55:53.851
I kicked out Zohra.


00:55:55.108 --> 00:55:57.670
She weighed on me.  Now I miss her.


00:56:03.269 --> 00:56:06.350
You don't believe in love
yet you have the symptoms.


00:56:06.479 --> 00:56:08.823
It's not love.  It's a passion.


00:56:09.256 --> 00:56:12.122
It destroys you
but you can't pull away.


00:56:17.244 --> 00:56:19.544
Passions must be quenched.


00:56:21.974 --> 00:56:24.361
Why not join her in Algeria?


00:57:09.669 --> 00:57:11.189
Stop.  I don't want to.


00:57:11.665 --> 00:57:13.664
Come on, just for once.


00:57:13.836 --> 00:57:15.182
I said to stop!


00:57:15.486 --> 00:57:16.485
It's no game!


00:57:50.205 --> 00:57:52.811
<i>I'll be in Algiers when you get this.</i>


00:57:52.984 --> 00:57:55.153
<i>You'll be good till I come home?</i>


00:57:55.325 --> 00:57:56.497
<i>Will you write?</i>


00:57:56.933 --> 00:57:57.932
<i>Think about me.</i>


00:59:11.146 --> 00:59:12.709
You can talk to me.


00:59:17.222 --> 00:59:18.567
I can't manage.


00:59:21.735 --> 00:59:23.992
I love one person in the world.


00:59:24.165 --> 00:59:26.119
Forget him.


00:59:26.943 --> 00:59:28.158
Come see.


00:59:28.939 --> 00:59:30.155
I can't.


00:59:32.976 --> 00:59:34.539
Wait, go on...


00:59:35.318 --> 00:59:37.273
Come see this ring.


00:59:37.446 --> 00:59:38.705
See it?


00:59:41.567 --> 00:59:43.912
Forget him.
He makes you unhappy.


00:59:45.129 --> 00:59:46.300
I can't.


00:59:53.808 --> 00:59:55.067
There.


00:59:55.240 --> 00:59:56.239
Perfect.


00:59:56.586 --> 00:59:57.672
You're pretty!


00:59:57.844 --> 00:59:59.233
Don't move.


01:00:01.750 --> 01:00:03.052
You're pretty.


01:00:03.442 --> 01:00:05.482
So pretty.  You get me hard.


01:00:07.132 --> 01:00:08.174
Please, Pierre.


01:00:11.948 --> 01:00:13.512
It made you laugh.


01:00:16.332 --> 01:00:17.896
I won one laugh.


01:00:19.457 --> 01:00:20.977
Bon appétit, my love.


01:00:22.018 --> 01:00:25.665
This frown soup is as good as
usual.


01:00:25.881 --> 01:00:28.094
Henri, you're perfect.


01:00:34.907 --> 01:00:35.820
So?


01:00:41.112 --> 01:00:42.328
Thank you, Helene.


01:00:44.152 --> 01:00:46.712
Marie is my most artistic
daughter.


01:00:46.843 --> 01:00:49.274
The most sensitive and fragile.


01:00:49.446 --> 01:00:51.443
Cheer her up, entertain her.


01:00:51.616 --> 01:00:53.656
Take her to the races.


01:00:53.830 --> 01:00:54.958
She loves horses.


01:00:55.088 --> 01:00:56.348
Go to the opera.


01:00:57.301 --> 01:00:59.906
- I don't know...
- She won't go out.


01:01:00.123 --> 01:01:02.293
I'm afraid to leave her alone.


01:01:03.681 --> 01:01:05.376
She's considering divorce.


01:01:06.111 --> 01:01:07.675
She's capable of anything.


01:01:07.849 --> 01:01:08.976
No...


01:01:09.149 --> 01:01:10.277
You know...


01:01:10.451 --> 01:01:13.881
Stop her melancholia.
Protect her from herself.


01:01:14.099 --> 01:01:15.444
Entertain her.


01:01:15.616 --> 01:01:17.959
Get her out of her room, dammit.


01:01:18.177 --> 01:01:21.216
Don't let her act like a little
girl.


01:01:21.389 --> 01:01:23.169
Behave like her husband.


01:01:24.991 --> 01:01:26.380
Yes, her husband.


01:01:57.541 --> 01:01:58.453
It's you.


01:01:59.406 --> 01:02:00.405
Jean!


01:02:02.141 --> 01:02:04.094
You're not a ghost?


01:02:04.615 --> 01:02:06.698
It would be possible here.


01:02:11.515 --> 01:02:13.251
I like that awful insect.


01:02:13.685 --> 01:02:14.684
And you?


01:02:14.856 --> 01:02:17.592
I admire it, as one admires
horrors.


01:02:18.199 --> 01:02:19.979
It's frightening up close.


01:02:20.281 --> 01:02:21.627
You're a scaredy-cat.


01:02:22.147 --> 01:02:23.841
Nothing scares me anymore.


01:02:30.394 --> 01:02:32.391
“Par arru sada”.


01:02:32.563 --> 01:02:33.345
All right.


01:02:34.821 --> 01:02:35.863
“Netsuke”.


01:02:35.993 --> 01:02:37.817
Yes... “Fly”.


01:02:39.724 --> 01:02:40.637
Funny.


01:02:42.155 --> 01:02:42.808
What?


01:02:42.979 --> 01:02:44.368
- Too many flies.
- Another.


01:02:44.846 --> 01:02:46.452
Mushroom and fly.


01:02:49.664 --> 01:02:51.226
“Fly and lotus leaf”.


01:02:51.399 --> 01:02:52.963
“Volubilis and fly”.


01:03:03.594 --> 01:03:04.722
Jean.


01:03:04.897 --> 01:03:06.373
To overcome your fears.


01:03:09.844 --> 01:03:10.930
Like it?


01:03:14.574 --> 01:03:16.573
My good-luck charm.


01:03:17.614 --> 01:03:19.177
Are you working?


01:03:19.349 --> 01:03:20.868
I'm writing.


01:03:20.998 --> 01:03:22.170
Willy is signing.


01:03:22.343 --> 01:03:24.080
Write for yourself.


01:03:24.254 --> 01:03:26.208
I adore what you do.


01:03:27.856 --> 01:03:28.681
You've read me?


01:03:29.201 --> 01:03:30.114
Of course.


01:03:33.367 --> 01:03:35.756
I'm proud you like something I did.


01:03:35.927 --> 01:03:37.187
I'm happy to see you.


01:03:39.747 --> 01:03:40.963
I get very bored.


01:03:43.391 --> 01:03:44.260
Without me?


01:03:44.781 --> 01:03:47.387
I didn't say that.
I said I'm bored.


01:03:47.603 --> 01:03:48.862
With someone else.


01:03:51.379 --> 01:03:52.638
You make me laugh.


01:03:53.462 --> 01:03:54.461
Good start.


01:03:54.633 --> 01:03:56.196
You looked so glum.


01:03:56.325 --> 01:03:58.583
I was afraid to tell you.


01:04:01.794 --> 01:04:02.793
Feeling better?


01:04:18.936 --> 01:04:20.760
It's... bitter.


01:04:21.193 --> 01:04:21.976
I like that.


01:04:22.798 --> 01:04:23.797
Taste.


01:04:28.442 --> 01:04:30.872
You'll see how evil my thoughts are.


01:04:36.731 --> 01:04:37.946
You think I'm silly.


01:04:39.900 --> 01:04:41.506
Silly?  No.


01:04:43.587 --> 01:04:44.673
Surprising.


01:04:45.888 --> 01:04:46.930
Shy.


01:04:52.181 --> 01:04:53.266
Intriguing.


01:04:54.654 --> 01:04:55.739
I feel...


01:04:56.304 --> 01:04:58.302
you'll make me suffer.


01:05:02.336 --> 01:05:04.247
- So you'll come.
