01:38:35.913 --> 01:38:37.823
Don't badmouth my friend.


01:38:38.256 --> 01:38:40.469
He's an artist, a great poet.


01:38:41.597 --> 01:38:43.292
Provided he doesn't forget it.


01:38:45.287 --> 01:38:46.893
Are you free for dinner?


01:38:47.847 --> 01:38:49.193
Not tonight.


01:38:51.622 --> 01:38:52.794
See you soon.


01:39:01.562 --> 01:39:05.251
<i>Remember one night
we lived a unique hour</i>


01:39:06.119 --> 01:39:08.246
<i>When gods grant one instant</i>


01:39:08.852 --> 01:39:10.372
<i>To the leaning head</i>


01:39:10.545 --> 01:39:12.239
<i>The trembling shoulder</i>


01:39:12.541 --> 01:39:15.537
<i>The pure spirit fleeing time</i>


01:39:16.839 --> 01:39:18.533
<i>Remember that one night</i>


01:39:19.313 --> 01:39:20.875
<i>Lying on our bed</i>


01:39:21.047 --> 01:39:23.784
<i>Stroking our fingers
quivering to unite</i>


01:39:25.041 --> 01:39:28.122
<i>We shared, mouth to mouth</i>


01:39:29.294 --> 01:39:32.896
<i>The indestructible pearl
where memory sleeps</i>


01:39:55.074 --> 01:39:59.458
Loosely based on the photographs and letters
of Pierre Louÿs and Marie de Régnier.


01:42:07.053 --> 01:42:09.527
Subtitles:  Andrew Litvack


01:42:09.700 --> 01:42:11.827
Subtitling TITRAFILM

